<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <%- include('partials/head') %>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="grain" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <main class="legal container">
    <div class="legal__header">
      <a href="/" class="brand">
        <span class="brand__crest"><span><%= brand.initials %></span></span>
        <span class="brand__name"><%= brand.name %></span>
      </a>
      <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="legal__updated">Last updated: <%= updated %></p>
    </div>

    <div class="legal__body">
      <p>
        These Terms of Service govern your use of <strong><%= config.baseUrl %></strong> and
        your WhatsApp communication with <strong><%= brand.name %></strong>
        (<%= brand.since %>), <%= brand.address %>. By using this website or messaging us on
        WhatsApp, you agree to these terms.
      </p>

      <h2>1. About Us</h2>
      <p><%= brand.name %> is a <%= brand.generation.toLowerCase() %> jewellery house based in
        <%= brand.city %>, India, dealing in BIS-hallmarked gold, certified diamond and polki
        jewellery, with manufacturing units in Agra and Surat.</p>

      <h2>2. Use of This Website</h2>
      <p>This website is provided to help you browse our catalogue and get in touch with us. You
        agree to use it only for legitimate personal or business enquiries, and not to misuse
        the enquiry form (for example, by submitting false information or automated/spam
        submissions).</p>

      <h2>3. Product Information &amp; Pricing</h2>
      <p>Product images, descriptions, weights and prices shown on this website are indicative
        and provided for reference only. Actual weight, making charges and final price depend
        on prevailing gold/diamond rates and are confirmed at the time of purchase, either at
        our showroom or via a formal invoice. We reserve the right to correct pricing or
        availability errors at any time.</p>

      <h2>4. Enquiries Are Not Orders</h2>
      <p>Submitting an enquiry through this website or WhatsApp does not create a binding sale.
        A purchase is only confirmed once we issue a formal invoice or confirm the order with
        you directly (in person, by phone, or on WhatsApp).</p>

      <h2>5. Wholesale &amp; Bespoke Enquiries</h2>
      <p>Wholesale supply and bespoke (custom-made) jewellery requests are handled on a
        case-by-case basis. Separate commercial terms, timelines and payment conditions for
        these will be agreed with you directly before any order is placed.</p>

      <h2>6. Communicating With Us on WhatsApp</h2>
      <p>By submitting our website form or sending us a WhatsApp message, you consent to
        receive a reply from us over WhatsApp, including an automated acknowledgement message.
        You can ask us to stop messaging you at any time.</p>

      <h2>7. Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p>All text, images, logos and designs on this website are the property of
        <%= brand.name %> unless otherwise noted, and may not be copied, reproduced or reused
        without our written permission.</p>

      <h2>8. Third-Party Links</h2>
      <p>Our website may link to third-party services such as Google Maps or Google Reviews.
        We are not responsible for the content or privacy practices of those third-party
        sites.</p>

      <h2>9. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>This website is provided "as is". While we take care to keep information accurate and
        the site available, we are not liable for indirect or consequential loss arising from
        your use of the website or delays in WhatsApp communication.</p>

      <h2>10. Governing Law</h2>
      <p>These terms are governed by the laws of India, and any dispute will be subject to the
        exclusive jurisdiction of the courts at Agra, Uttar Pradesh.</p>

      <h2>11. Changes to These Terms</h2>
      <p>We may update these Terms of Service from time to time. Continued use of the website
        after changes are posted constitutes acceptance of the revised terms.</p>

      <h2>12. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>Questions about these terms can be sent to us on WhatsApp or by phone at
        <strong><%= brand.phoneDisplay %></strong>, or in person at <%= brand.address %>.</p>

      <p class="legal__back"><a href="/">&larr; Back to home</a></p>
    </div>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
